{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122120396919101378+-+Thank+you%2C+Senate+District+21.I+am+deeply+grateful+for+the+trust+you+have+placed+in+me+tonight.This+campaign+began+with+a+belief+that+the+people+who+live+here+should+have+a+meaningful+voice+in+the+decisions+that+shape+our+communities+and+our+state.+Over+the+past+several+months%2C+you+opened+your+doors%2C+shared+your+concerns%2C+challenged+me+with+hard+questions%2C+and+told+me+what+you+hope+Wyoming+can+become.I+heard+you.+And+I+will+keep+hearing+you.Thank+you+to+everyone+who+volunteered%2C+contributed%2C+encouraged+me%2C+and+worked+so+hard+to+make+this+possible.+Thank+you+to+everyone+who+voted%E2%80%94whether+you+voted+for+me+or+not%E2%80%94for+participating+in+the+process+and+caring+about+the+future+of+our+communities.Tonight+is+not+the+end+of+that+responsibility.+It+is+the+beginning+of+a+new+one.Thank+you+for+your+trust.+I+will+work+hard+to+earn+it+every+day.#butcherforwyoming #always"
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122120774835101378+-+A+friend+shared+with+me+today+a+photo+of+an+offensive+message+that+was+written+in+chalk+outside+my+opponent%27s+home+around+Election+Day.+This+is+the+first+I+have+heard+about+this+incident.Ken+and+I+had+real+differences+during+this+campaign%2C+but+we+were+cordial+and+respectful+toward+one+another+throughout+it.+I+appreciated+that.During+this+campaign%2C+I+made+a+pledge+to+treat+those+who+disagree+with+me+as+neighbors%2C+not+enemies.+I+meant+it+then%2C+and+I+mean+it+now.What+happened+at+Ken%27s+home+isn%27t+okay.+Political+disagreement+does+not+justify+vulgarity+or+disrespect+toward+someone+or+their+family.I+don%27t+know+who+was+responsible%2C+and+I+won%27t+speculate.+But+the+standard+shouldn%27t+depend+on+whose+candidate+won+or+lost.We+can+disagree.+We+can+argue+our+case.+We+can+vote+differently.+And+when+it%27s+over%2C+we%27re+still+neighbors."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122121053241101378+-+It+may+still+be+August%2C+but+apparently+it%27s+back-to-school+season+for+me%2C+too.January+will+be+here+before+we+know+it%2C+and+I%27m+trying+to+make+good+use+of+the+time+between+now+and+then+to+prepare+for+the+job+I%27ve+been+nominated+to+do.I%27m+following+the+legislative+committees+that+meet+between+sessions.+A+lot+of+that+work+grows+out+of+the+last+legislative+session.+Some+issues+needed+more+study%2C+some+questions+weren%27t+resolved%2C+and+some+things+simply+need+a+closer+look+before+lawmakers+take+them+up+again.+Those+committees+are+also+developing+proposals+that+may+come+before+us+in+2027.I%27m+following+work+on+property+taxes%2C+education+and+school+finance%2C+elections%2C+energy%2C+health+care%2C+state+spending+and+local+government.+That+means+reading+committee+materials+and+recent+legislation%2C+looking+at+what%27s+been+tried+before+and+talking+with+current+legislators+and+others+who+know+these+issues+well.There+is+no+shortage+of+reading+material.+%F0%9F%99%82I%27m+also+building+the+systems+I+would+use+to+evaluate+legislation%2C+track+bills+and+amendments+and+follow+fiscal+impacts.+Just+as+important%2C+I+don%27t+want+what+I+hear+from+constituents+to+simply+land+in+an+inbox+somewhere.+I+want+to+connect+those+conversations+to+the+issues+I%27m+working+on+and+be+able+to+report+back+on+what+happened.The+primary+is+behind+us%2C+but+the+questions+Wyoming+Republicans+have+been+asking+about+spending%2C+taxes%2C+property+rights%2C+elections%2C+individual+liberty+and+the+proper+role+of+government+are+still+very+much+in+front+of+us.+Those+issues+don%27t+belong+to+one+candidate+or+one+caucus.We%27re+not+always+going+to+agree+on+the+answer.+That%27s+just+reality+when+you%27re+dealing+with+complex%2C+layered+issues+and+systems.+If+I%27m+elected+in+November%2C+my+job+will+be+to+understand+the+problem+we%27re+trying+to+solve+and+what+the+Constitution+and+current+law+require%2C+then+look+hard+at+the+costs%2C+consequences+and+whether+a+proposal+actually+makes+things+better.Over+the+next+several+months%2C+I%27ll+share+some+of+what+I%27m+following+and+working+through%2C+including+some+of+the+questions+I+have+along+the+way.+And+please+keep+telling+me+what+you%27re+seeing+and+thinking%2C+too."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122121599013101378+-+%E2%80%9CWe+should+all+be+asking+the+question%E2%80%A6+%E2%80%98What+am+I+doing+to+make+my+community+better%3F%E2%80%99%E2%80%9DYears+ago%2C+when+I+worked+for+the+Wyoming+Department+of+Transportation%2C+I+spent+quite+a+bit+of+time+in+Newcastle+as+WYDOT+prepared+to+reconstruct+Main+Street.+My+job+was+public+outreach+%E2%80%94+talking+with+residents+and+business+owners%2C+gathering+their+input+about+how+the+street+should+function+and+what+kinds+of+improvements+and+amenities+they+wanted+to+see+as+part+of+the+project.One+of+my+first+projects+after+joining+WYDOT+involved+very+similar+work+right+here+in+Sheridan%2C+as+Main+Street+was+being+revitalized.+Those+projects+gave+me+a+front-row+seat+to+just+how+much+people+care+about+the+places+they+call+home+%E2%80%94+and+how+important+it+is+that+they+have+a+meaningful+voice+when+decisions+are+being+made+about+those+places.What+I+remember+most+is+how+much+people+cared+about+getting+it+right+for+their+communities.So+it+was+especially+nice+to+see+that+video+all+these+years+later+and+see+a+downtown+that+continues+to+be+active%2C+attractive+and+very+much+a+part+of+the+life+of+Newcastle.Communities+don%E2%80%99t+become+vibrant+because+of+one+project%2C+one+organization+or+one+person.+They+become+vibrant+because%2C+over+many+years%2C+people+keep+showing+up%2C+listening+to+one+another+and+investing+their+time+and+energy+in+the+places+they+call+home.That%E2%80%99s+certainly+true+here+in+Sheridan+County%2C+too.And+it%E2%80%99s+a+good+reminder+for+me+as+I+prepare+to+serve+in+the+Senate%3A+the+best+decisions+start+with+understanding+what+a+community+values%2C+making+sure+people+have+a+meaningful+voice+and+working+to+turn+that+vision+into+results."
},
{
"text": "Share by Email",
"href": "mailto:?subject=Facebook&body=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.facebook.com%2F965024480035285_122125398315101378+-+Formal+Senate+training+starts+in+December+and+continues+in+January%2C+but+I%E2%80%99m+not+much+of+a+wait-until-then+person.Since+the+primary%2C+I%E2%80%99ve+been+using+this+time+to+prepare.+I%E2%80%99ve+been+reviewing+past+committee+work+and+legislation%2C+spending+time+with+the+state+budget%2C+talking+with+people+who+know+these+issues+well%2C+and+looking+closely+at+what+may+be+coming+in+2027.I%E2%80%99m+also+exploring+some+possible+legislation+of+my+own%2C+based+on+conversations+with+constituents+during+the+campaign.I%E2%80%99ve+been+thinking+about+how+easy+it+would+be%2C+as+a+new+legislator%2C+to+feel+like+I+need+to+prove+myself+by+introducing+bills%2C+and+I+don%E2%80%99t+want+to+fall+into+that+trap.+Good+legislation+starts+with+a+real+problem%2C+then+asks+whether+a+new+law+is+actually+the+right+way+to+solve+it.+That+means+understanding+what%E2%80%99s+happening%2C+who+is+affected%2C+what+is+causing+the+problem%2C+and+what+else+might+change+if+we+act.Property+tax+is+a+good+example.+If+voters+approve+the+50%25+residential+property+tax+initiative+in+November%2C+the+Legislature+will+have+to+deal+with+the+effects+on+schools%2C+counties%2C+towns+and+other+local+services.+That+will+require+more+than+a+quick+fix.I+think+this+is+also+part+of+restoring+confidence+in+how+the+Legislature+does+its+work.+Do+the+homework.+Ask+the+hard+questions.+Understand+the+tradeoffs.+Listen+to+the+people+who+will+live+with+the+results.Passing+more+bills+isn%E2%80%99t+the+measure+of+a+good+session.+Solving+real+problems+well+is.%E2%9D%93What+problem+do+YOU+think+state+government+needs+to+understand+better+before+it+tries+to+fix+it%3F%E2%9D%93%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E2%80%94-Ballot+language+note%3A+BE+PREPARED+to+vote+on+November+3.+The+Wyoming+Secretary+of+State+has+posted+the+official+2026+statewide+ballot+proposition+for+the+%E2%80%9CPeople%E2%80%99s+Initiative+to+Limit+Property+Tax+in+Wyoming+through+a+Homeowner%E2%80%99s+Property+Exemption%E2%80%9D+at+sos.wyo.gov%2FElections%2FDocs%2F2026%2F2026_Statewide_Ballot_Propositions.pdf.+The+ballot+language+includes+the+estimated+revenue+impact+of+the+initiative+to+the+State+of+Wyoming+for+fiscal+years+2028+and+2029%2C+noting+that+this+estimate+%E2%80%9Cdoes+not+include+an+estimate+of+any+impact+upon+political+subdivisions.+The+proposition+references+a+beginning+in+2025%2C+but+if+passed+in+2026+the+earliest+applicable+tax+year+would+be+2027%2C+with+impact+to+the+state+beginning+in+2028.+Fiscal+impact+will+apply+to+each+year+so+long+as+the+exemption+is+in+place.+Future+impacts+depend+on+unpredictable+economic+conditions.%E2%80%9D%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E2%80%94%E2%80%94Photo%3A+Tony+Webster+%2F+CC+BY+2.0"
},
